[133.429947, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000fNorth of House\u001b[154G6\r\u001b[37d\u001b[m\u000fNorth of House\r\u001b[38dYou are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.\r\u001b[40d>"]
