[175.506681, "o", "5\r\u001b[34d"]
[175.506775, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fLiving Room\r\u001b[35d"]
[175.506987, "o", "You are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy\r\u001b[36d"]
[175.507084, "o", "case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\r\u001b[37d"]
[175.507207, "o", "Above the trophy case hangs an elvish sword of great antiquity.\r\u001b[38dA battery-powered brass lantern is on the trophy case.\r\u001b[40d"]
