[355.587919, "i", "look\n"]
[355.588476, "o", "look"]
[355.588724, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[355.588771, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001bM\u001b[154G\u001b[0;7m\u000f40\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fKitchen\r\u001b[37d"]
[355.589007, "m", "Episode 9: 3 commands"]
[355.589007, "o", "You are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark\r\u001b[38dstaircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[383.932649, "i", "west\n"]
[383.933042, "o", "west\r\u001b[2d"]
[383.933077, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fLiving Room\u001b[155G"]
[383.933454, "o", "1\r\u001b[38d\u001b[m\u000fLiving Room\r\u001b[40d>"]
[384.206562, "i", "move rug\n"]
[384.207161, "o", "move rug"]
[384.207283, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f2\r\u001b[38d\u001b[m\u000fWith a great effort, the rug is moved to one side of the room, revealing the dusty cover of a closed trap door.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[384.469549, "i", "look\n"]
[384.470359, "o", "loo"]
[384.470645, "o", "k"]
[384.470961, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[5M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f3\r\u001b[36d"]
[384.471236, "m", "Episode 10: 3 commands"]
[384.471236, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fLiving Room\r\u001b[37dYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy\r\u001b[38dcase, and a closed trap door at your feet.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[391.759588, "i", "open trap door\n"]
[391.760165, "o", "o"]
[391.76044, "o", "pen"]
[391.761256, "o", " trap door"]
[391.761481, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f4\r\u001b[38d\u001b[m\u000fThe door reluctantly opens to reveal a rickety staircase descending into darkness.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[392.119687, "i", "down\n"]
[392.120003, "o", "d"]
[392.120154, "o", "o"]
[392.120405, "o", "wn"]
[392.122082, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[392.122496, "o", "\u001b[8M\u001bM\u001b[C"]
[392.122776, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000fCellar     \u001b[1;138H"]
[392.123003, "o", "35\u001b[155G"]
[392.123407, "o", "5\r\u001b[33d"]
[392.123722, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fThe trap door crashes shut, and you hear someone barring it.\r\u001b[35d"]
[392.124051, "o", "Cellar\r\u001b[36d"]
[392.124357, "o", "You are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[37d"]
[392.12464, "o", "unclimbable.\r\u001b[38d"]
[392.124834, "o", "Your sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.\r\u001b[40d"]
[392.125055, "o", ">"]
[392.403849, "i", "look\n"]
[392.404536, "o", "l"]
[392.407448, "o", "o"]
[392.410085, "o", "o"]
[392.412555, "o", "k"]
[392.418355, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[392.421507, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001bM\u001b[155G"]
[392.42309, "m", "Episode 11: 2 commands"]
[392.42309, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f6\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fCellar\r\u001b[37dYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[38dunclimbable.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[405.173144, "i", "north\n"]
[405.173682, "o", "no"]
[405.173728, "o", "rth"]
[405.174038, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[7M\u001bM\u001b[C"]
[405.174239, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000fThe Troll Room\u001b[155G7\r\u001b[34d\u001b[m\u000fThe Troll Room\r\u001b[35dThis is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[36dwalls.\r\u001b[37dA nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[38dYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[405.466499, "i", "look\n"]
[405.466787, "o", "l"]
[405.466894, "o", "o"]
[405.467039, "o", "ok"]
[405.467411, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[7M\u001bM\u001b[155G"]
[405.467537, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f8\r\u001b[34d\u001b[m\u000fThe Troll Room\r\u001b[35d"]
[405.467635, "o", "This is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[36d"]
[405.468307, "o", "walls.\r\u001b[37dA nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[38d"]
[405.4684, "m", "Episode 12: 2 commands"]
[405.4684, "o", "The troll's swing almost knocks you over as you barely parry in time.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[412.677501, "i", "attack troll with sword\n"]
[412.679595, "o", "attack troll with sword\r\u001b[2d"]
[412.679748, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001bM\u001b[C"]
[412.679848, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000fForest        \u001b[1;138H"]
[412.679988, "o", "2\u001b[155G"]
[412.680096, "o", "9\r\u001b[29d"]
[412.680227, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fYour sword misses the troll by an inch.\r\u001b[30dThe troll neatly removes your head.\r\u001b[31d"]
[412.680584, "o", "It appears that that last blow was too much for you. I'm afraid you are dead.\u001b[33;4H****  You have died  ****\r\u001b[35dNow, let's take a look here... Well, you probably deserve another chance. I can't quite fix you up completely, but you can't have everything.\r\u001b[37dForest\r\u001b[38d"]
[412.680682, "o", "This is a forest, with trees in all directions. To the east, there appears to be sunlight.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[413.01052, "i", "look\n"]
[413.010812, "o", "l"]
[413.010959, "o", "ook"]
[413.011289, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[9M\u001bM\u001b[154G"]
[413.011353, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f50\r\u001b[32d\u001b[m\u000fForest\r\u001b[33dThis is a forest, with trees in all directions. To the east, there appears to be sunlight.\r\u001b[34dThere is a brown sack here.\r\u001b[35d"]
[413.011468, "m", "Episode 13: 28 commands"]
[413.011468, "o", "The brown sack contains:\u001b[36;3HA lunch\u001b[37;3HA clove of garlic\r\u001b[38dThere is a sword here.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[455.050902, "i", "quit\n"]
[455.051356, "o", "quit"]
[455.051638, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001b[38dYour score is 25 (total of 350 points), in 50 moves.\r\u001b[39dThis gives you the rank of Beginner.\r\u001b[40d"]
[455.0518, "o", "Do you wish to leave the game? (Y is affirmative): >"]
