[676.808748, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[4M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fNorth of House\u001b[154G3\r\u001b[37d\u001b[m\u000fNorth of House\r\u001b[38dYou are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[677.051219, "i", "east\n"]
[677.051871, "o", "e"]
