[677.408543, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[154G"]
[677.408778, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f5\r\u001b[38d"]
[677.408954, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fWith great effort, you open the window far enough to allow entry.\r\u001b[40d"]
[677.409117, "o", ">"]
[677.692802, "i", "enter\n"]
[677.693057, "o", "en"]
[677.693635, "o", "ter"]
[677.693926, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[9M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fKitchen     \u001b[1;138H10\u001b[154G"]
[677.69407, "o", "6\r\u001b[32d\u001b[m\u000fKitchen\r\u001b[33d"]
[677.694111, "o", "You are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark\r\u001b[34dstaircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\r\u001b[35dOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\r\u001b[36dA bottle is sitting on the table.\r\u001b[37dThe glass bottle contains:\u001b[38;3HA quantity of water\r\u001b[40d>"]
[677.9823, "i", "west\n"]
[677.983101, "o", "west"]
[677.983604, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[677.983922, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fLiving Room\u001b[154G"]
[677.984858, "o", "7\r\u001b[34d\u001b[m\u000fLiving Room\r\u001b[35dYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy\r\u001b[36dcase, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\r\u001b[37dAbove the trophy case hangs an elvish sword of great antiquity.\r\u001b[38dA battery-powered brass lantern is on the trophy case.\r\u001b[40d>"]
