[693.302111, "o", "look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[5M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f3\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fCellar\r\u001b[37dYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[38dunclimbable.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[702.321797, "i", "north\n"]
[702.322177, "o", "north"]
[702.322586, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[702.322827, "o", "\u001b[17M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fForest\u001b[1;138H2\u001b[155G4\r\u001b[24d\u001b[m\u000fThe Troll Room\r\u001b[25dThis is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[26dwalls.\r\u001b[27dA nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[28dYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\u001b[29dThe flat of the troll's axe hits you delicately on the head, knocking you out.\r\u001b[30d"]
[702.322886, "o", "Conquering his fears, the troll puts you to death.\r\u001b[31dIt appears that that last blow was too much for you. I'm afraid you are dead.\u001b[33;4H****  You have died  ****\r\u001b[35dNow, let's take a look here... Well, you probably deserve another chance. I can't quite fix you up completely, but you can't have everything.\r\u001b[37dForest\r\u001b[38dThis is a forest, with trees in all directions. To the east, there appears to be sunlight.\r\u001b[40d"]
[702.32291, "o", ">"]
