[724.078919, "o", "2\u001b[155G"]
[724.079175, "o", "6\r\u001b[28d"]
[724.079439, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fClang! Crash! The troll parries.\r\u001b[29d"]
[724.079787, "o", "The flat of the troll's axe hits you delicately on the head, knocking you out.\r\u001b[30d"]
[724.080052, "o", "Conquering his fears, the troll puts you to death.\r\u001b[31d"]
[724.080306, "o", "It appears that that last blow was too much for you. I'm afraid you are dead.\u001b[33;4H"]
[724.080577, "o", "****  You have died  ****\r\u001b[35d"]
[724.080856, "o", "Now, let's take a look here... Well, you probably deserve another chance. I can't quite fix you up completely, but you can't have everything.\r\u001b[37d"]
[724.081092, "o", "Forest\r\u001b[38d"]
[724.081343, "o", "This is a forest, with trees in all directions. To the east, there appears to be sunlight.\r\u001b[40d"]
