[1065.877793, "o", "This is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[36d"]
[1065.878045, "o", "walls.\r\u001b[37d"]
[1065.878252, "o", "A nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[38d"]
[1065.878496, "o", "Your sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\u001b[40d"]
