[1092.130393, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[4M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f1\r\u001b[37d\u001b[m\u000fEast of Chasm\r\u001b[38dYou are on the east edge of a chasm, the bottom of which cannot be seen. A narrow passage goes north, and the path you are on continues to the east.\r\u001b[40d>"]
