[1217.480037, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001b[38dOk.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[1217.982715, "i", "north\n"]
[1217.983695, "o", "north\r\u001b[2d\u001b[7M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fStudio \u001b[155G5\r\u001b[34d\u001b[m\u000fStudio\r\u001b[35dThis appears to have been an artist's studio. The walls and floors are splattered with paints of 69 different colors. Strangely enough, nothing of value is\r\u001b[36dhanging here. At the south end of the room is an open door (also covered with paint). A dark and narrow chimney leads up from a fireplace; although you might be\u001b[37;1Hable to get up it, it seems unlikely you could get back down.\r\u001b[38dLoosely attached to a wall is a small piece of paper.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[1218.287048, "i", "look\n"]
[1218.288074, "o", "look"]
