[1218.289077, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fStudio\r\u001b[35d"]
[1218.289257, "o", "This appears to have been an artist's studio. The walls and floors are splattered with paints of 69 different colors. Strangely enough, nothing of value is\r\u001b[36d"]
[1218.289449, "o", "hanging here. At the south end of the room is an open door (also covered with paint). A dark and narrow chimney leads up from a fireplace; although you might be\u001b[37;1H"]
[1218.289656, "o", "able to get up it, it seems unlikely you could get back down.\r\u001b[38d"]
[1218.289847, "o", "Loosely attached to a wall is a small piece of paper.\r\u001b[40d"]
